  - title: LEVEL 28 | Charge the Capacitor
    explanation: 5V -> MAIN -> 1N5819 anode/cathode -> 220 Ohm -> SPDT_A -> COM ->
      capacitor positive. Capacitor negative returns to Battery_negative. SPDT_B
      is open; the 330 Ohm LED load and 1k bleed are isolated. Charge to at least
      approximately 4.4V, model dependent.
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | MAIN ON | A-to-COM CLOSED
    parts:
    - id: battery
