  - title: LEVEL 28 | Emergency Backup
    explanation: Switch main supply OFF first. Then move SPDT to BACKUP. SPDT_COM
      connects charged capacitor+ to SPDT_B. B feeds 330 Ohm -> LED anode -> LED
      cathode -> battery negative, and 1k Ohm -> battery negative in parallel. The
      capacitor supplies both loads and discharges.
    caption: PAGE 3/4 | MAIN OFF | COM-to-B CLOSED
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
