  - title: LEVEL 28 | Six Phase-Based Goals
    explanation: Validate all 11 wires and six slots; capacitor voltage reaches >=4.4V
      in charge; holds >=4.2V briefly while isolated; backup LED turns ON when COM-B
      selected; LED stays ON >=0.35 s; capacitor falls by >=1.0V and LED eventually
      OFF. Temporal objectives require a level-specific phase evaluator, not simultaneous
      static targets. Exact thresholds must be tuned in Play Mode.
    caption: PAGE 4/4 | CHARGE -> ISOLATE -> BACKUP
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.09, y: 0.55}
      label: 5 V DC
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.33, b: 0.4, a: 1}
